OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786619903
OL,3,CThe Bog Squad: Restoring the North
OL,4,CWest moorlands
OL,6,FGranada Reports correspondent Mel
OL,7,FBarham reports from Darwen
OL,9,FA wildlife trust has been restoring
OL,10,Fthe moorlands after recent wild fires
OL,11,Facross the region.
OL,13,FIn the North West, serious fires have
OL,14,Fburned in Tintwistle, Dovestones,
OL,15,FMacclesfield Forest, and Darwen after
OL,16,Fa summer of extreme heat.
OL,18,FLancashire Wildlife Trust have been on
OL,19,Fthe moorland at Darwen, planting dwarf
OL,20,Fshrub plants to make the area more
OL,21,Fmoist and fire resistant.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786619903
OL,3,CThe Bog Squad: Restoring the North
OL,4,CWest moorlands
OL,6,FThe work they had already done
OL,7,Frestoring that site, meant that one
OL,8,Ffire on Darwen Moor only burnt for
OL,9,Ffour hours.
OL,11,FLois Clark, Lancashire Peak
OL,12,FPartnership Engagement Officer, said:
OL,13,F"If it wasn't a rewetted site, if we
OL,14,Fhadn't come in and started our
OL,15,Frestoration works then it could have
OL,16,Fbeen burning for days."
OL,18,FOver the next few months they will be
OL,19,Fplanting around 40,000 plugs of five
OL,20,Fdifferent species into this stretch of
OL,21,Fland.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786619903
OL,3,CThe Bog Squad: Restoring the North
OL,4,CWest moorlands
OL,6,FLois said: "We're basically putting
OL,7,Fthe correct vegetation back in the
OL,8,Fcorrect places. When bogs or peatlands
OL,9,Fare becoming degraded all of those
OL,10,Fshrubs and the vegetation is
OL,11,Fdisappearing so by planting it back in
OL,12,Fwe're just putting the right plants
OL,13,Fback in."
OL,15,FThe team have been focusing on
OL,16,Freducing purple moor grass, a natural
OL,17,Fplant often found in peatland soils.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786619903
OL,3,CThe Bog Squad: Restoring the North
OL,4,CWest moorlands
OL,6,FJenny Bennion, Communications Officer
OL,7,Ffor Lancashire Wildfire Trust said:
OL,8,F"Purple moor grass is a wonderful
OL,9,Fplant, it's a natural part of our
OL,10,Fpeatlands, but unfortunately when our
OL,11,Fpeatlands become degraded or damaged
OL,12,Fin any way, it can start to take over.
OL,14,F"It will out compete other plants that
OL,15,Fshould naturally be here that are part
OL,16,Fof that really important balanced
OL,17,Fecosystem that we're trying to
OL,18,Fachieve, but also it will create fire
OL,19,Fload.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786619903
OL,3,CThe Bog Squad: Restoring the North
OL,4,CWest moorlands
OL,6,F"Over winter it will die back and that
OL,7,Fcauses this layer of thatch which
OL,8,Fagain is just fuel load."
OL,10,FShe added: "What we're doing is by
OL,11,Fputting in other plants, we're hoping
OL,12,Fto knock the purple moor grass back a
OL,13,Fbit and stop it being so dominant.
OL,15,F"Also we'll do things like we'll mow
OL,16,Fit so we have these big amazing
OL,17,Frobotic mowers that come up and
OL,18,Fthey'll just help knock it back, take
OL,19,Fsome of the vigour away, and also take
OL,20,Fthat fuel load out.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786619903
OL,3,CThe Bog Squad: Restoring the North
OL,4,CWest moorlands
OL,6,F"We want some of it, we just don't
OL,7,Fwant quite as much of it."
OL,9,FEvery plug they plant will help
OL,10,Fmitigate the dangers of our heating
OL,11,Fplanet.
OL,13,FThe Trust's work comes as Prime
OL,14,FMinister Andy Burnham held an
OL,15,Femergency Cobra meeting on Wednesday
OL,16,F12 August, in response to the
OL,17,Fprolonged spell of exceptionally hot
OL,18,Fand dry weather.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786619903
OL,3,CThe Bog Squad: Restoring the North
OL,4,CWest moorlands
OL,6,FMr Burnham urged "retailers big and
OL,7,Fsmall" to pull disposable barbecues
OL,8,Ffrom their shelves as he warned
OL,9,Fextreme heat conditions "could be with
OL,10,Fus for some weeks yet".
OL,12,FSpeaking from the Downing Street
OL,13,Fgarden, the PM said: "The big risk in
OL,14,Fterms of risk to the wider regions
OL,15,Facross the country is the risk of
OL,16,Fwildfires. What we are seeing is
OL,17,Fmultiple serious incidents across the
OL,18,Fcountry.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786619903
OL,3,CThe Bog Squad: Restoring the North
OL,4,CWest moorlands
OL,6,F"Fire services by and large are
OL,7,Fsupporting each other through mutual
OL,8,Faid to deal with those incidents, but
OL,9,Fwe are keeping a very close watching
OL,10,Fbrief on them.
OL,12,F"There is advice to the public here
OL,13,Fnot to use disposable barbecues. We
OL,14,Fhave today confirmed through the
OL,15,FNational Fire Chiefs Council that the
OL,16,Fframework restricting the retail sale
OL,17,Fof those disposable barbecues is being
OL,18,Fextended."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786619903
OL,3,CThe Bog Squad: Restoring the North
OL,4,CWest moorlands
OL,6,F"Longer term we will look at whether a
OL,7,Ftemporary ban in the summer months is
OL,8,Fjustified," Burnham added.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
